 "text": "Hi, how have you been? You can cook them at the grill, or cut them and keep them in the oven until you get in. How many steaks are they? Keep them about an inch apart from the grill, and go for as long as they need. Or, cut and put in the warm oven? You' stop cooking completely, just take longer. Keep the oven as high as it goes. She' want to try them on the grill next time. Cut them while they' still hot, and serve with something warm. Try it first, then ask her politely whether she'd like to try grilling with the real thing next time. Back up with the oven for tonight.",
